From a38ae5d0710c923ba7346048d2b30bd5a1391722 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 20:21:11 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 06/23] net: dwc_eth_qos: Add Allwinner A733 / sun60iw2 GMAC
 glue support

Add DWC ETH QOS glue logic for Allwinner A733 / A523 (sun60iw2 / sun55i) SoCs.
- Configures GMAC 2.1.0 SYSCON with RGMII interface mode
- Configures active-low clock gate at offset 0x80 and MBUS DMA gate
- Integrates PHY reset GPIO control, clock/reset management, and SID MAC derivation

The GMAC 2.1.0 syscon register programming and clock gating sequence are
derived from Allwinner's Linux sunxi_gmac.c driver and adapted to U-Boot's
dwc_eth_qos driver model.

Signed-off-by: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Assisted-by: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>
---
